"（E2-1）建立清晰对应关系。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:esg.action_view_esg_action
msgid ""
"Actions are the specific steps or measures that an organization takes to "
"implement its ESG strategy.\n"
"                They are the actionable items that help achieve its ESG "
"goals, including the targets set to track progress over time."
msgstr ""
"行动是组织为落实其 ESG 战略而采取的具体步骤或措施。\n"
"                行动是有助于实现其 ESG 目标的可执行事项，包括为跟踪进展而设定"
"的目标。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e3
msgid ""
"Actions focus on <strong>avoiding</strong>, <strong>reducing</strong>,\n"
"                                and <strong>\n"
"                                    restoring</strong> water and marine "
"impacts. Resources are\n"
"                                allocated through environmental budgets, "
"with performance monitored\n"
"                                via specific water-related KPIs."
msgstr ""
"行动重点在于<strong>避免</strong> ，<strong>减少</strong> ，\n"
"                                以及"
"<strong>                                    恢复</strong> 水资源及海洋生态系"
"统。资源\n"
"                                通过环境预算进行分配，绩效则\n"
"                                通过特定的水资源相关关键绩效指标（KPI）进行监"
"测。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
msgid ""
"Actions follow the mitigation hierarchy: avoidance, reduction,\n"
"                                restoration, and\n"
"                                offsetting. Local communities and indigenous "
"knowledge are\n"
"                                incorporated.\n"
"                                Biodiversity offsets are documented with "
"area, type, quality\n"
"                                criteria, and\n"
"                                standards."
msgstr ""
"行动遵循缓解优先级顺序：避免、减少、\n"
"                                恢复和\n"
"                                补偿。将当地社区和原住民知识\n"
"                                纳入其中。\n"
"                                生物多样性补偿措施需记录面积、类型、质量\n"
"                                标准及\n"
"                                规范。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b7
msgid ""
"Actions implemented by {{ company_name }} to support its circular economy "
"approach and improve waste management:"
msgstr "{{ company_name }} 为支持其循环经济策略并改善废弃物管理而采取的措施："

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s4
msgid ""
"Actions include\n"
"                                            product redesigns,\n"
"                                            privacy-compliance programs, "
"recall campaigns, and\n"
"                                            consumer education\n"
"                                            initiatives. Effectiveness is "
"measured by reductions in\n"
"                                            complaints,\n"
