#: model:ir.actions.client,name:esg.ir_actions_esg_dashboard_action
#: model:ir.ui.menu,name:esg.menu_esg_dashboard
msgid "Dashboard"
msgstr "仪表板"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_social_b
msgid "Data Collection Methods"
msgstr "数据收集方式"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_social_b
msgid "Data Sources"
msgstr "数据来源"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Data are collected through Continuous Emissions Monitoring Systems (CEMS) "
"for air\n"
"                pollutants (e.g., NOₓ, SOₓ, PM), complemented by periodic "
"sampling and laboratory\n"
"                analyses for water and soil parameters."
msgstr ""
"空气污染物（氮氧化物、硫氧化物、颗粒物等）数据依托连续排放监测系统（CEMS）采"
"集；水体、土壤指标辅以定期取样与实验室检测分析。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_social_b
msgid ""
"Data are collected through Human Resources Information Systems (HRIS), "
"payroll,\n"
"                attendance, learning management, and occupational safety "
"systems. Additional\n"
"                information comes from employee surveys, grievance "
"platforms, and union or works\n"
"                council reports."
msgstr ""
"数据取自人力资源信息系统（HRIS）、薪资系统、考勤系统、学习管理系统及职业安全"
"系统；补充信息来源于员工调研、申诉平台、工会或职工委员会报告。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_social_b
msgid ""
"Data are collected through field surveys, participatory consultations,\n"
"                        project monitoring systems, and third-party reports. "
"Where direct data are\n"
"                        unavailable, estimates or external databases are "
"used."
msgstr ""
"通过实地调研、参与式磋商、项目监测系统及第三方报告采集数据；无法获取原始实测"
"数据时，则采用估算值或外部数据库数据。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Data are collected through material flow analysis (MFA), life-cycle\n"
"                    assessment (LCA), and internal production monitoring "
"systems. Information covers\n"
"                    inputs (raw, renewable, and secondary materials) and "
"outputs (products,\n"
"                    packaging, and waste). When primary data are "
"unavailable, supplier declarations\n"
"                    and modeled estimates are used following EU "
"Environmental Footprint or ISO 14044\n"
"                    standards."
msgstr ""
"依托物质流分析（MFA）、生命周期评估（LCA）与内部生产监控系统收集数据，涵盖投"
"入端（原材料、可再生原料、再生材料）与产出端（产品、包装、废弃物）。若无一手"
"数据，将依据欧盟环境足迹标准、ISO 14044 标准，采用供应商声明与模型估算数据。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_governance_c
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_social_b
msgid "Data are collected through:"
msgstr "数据通过以下方式收集："

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e3
msgid ""
"Data are compiled from\n"
"                                    site-level monitoring, covering both "
"direct measurements and\n"
"                                    modeled estimates. Reporting follows "
"the<em>\n"
"                                        <strong> GHG Protocol Water Guidance "
"and the WRI Aqueduct\n"
"                                    risk tool</strong>\n"
"                                    </em>."
msgstr ""
"数据汇编自\n"
"                                    站点级监测，涵盖直接测量和\n"
"                                    模型估算。报告编制遵循<em>\n"
"                                        <strong> 《温室气体协议水资源指南》以"
"及世界资源研究所（WRI）Aqueduct\n"
"                                    风险评估工具</strong>\n"
"                                    </em> 。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_governance_c
msgid ""
"Data are consolidated and reviewed internally by compliance, internal audit, "
"and\n"
"                sustainability teams."
msgstr "数据由合规、内部审计与可持续发展团队汇总并开展内部审核。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_social_b
msgid ""
"Data are consolidated and reviewed internally by consumer experience, "
"product\n"
"                        safety, compliance, or sustainability teams."
msgstr "数据由消费者体验、产品安全、合规或可持续发展团队汇总并开展内部审核。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_social_b
msgid ""
"Data are consolidated and reviewed internally by the HR and sustainability "
"teams."
msgstr "数据由人力资源与可持续发展团队汇总并开展内部审核。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Data are gathered from site-level environmental surveys, GIS and\n"
"                    remote-sensing tools, and ecological monitoring "
"programs. Key indicators include\n"
"                    land use, habitat condition, and species presence, "
"measured against recognized\n"
"                    frameworks such as IUCN Habitat Classification or TNFD "
"guidelines. When direct\n"
"                    data are unavailable, modeled estimates or external "
"databases (e.g., GBIF, IPBES\n"
"                    regional data) are used."
msgstr ""
"数据来源于站点级环境调查、地理信息系统（GIS）和\n"
"                    遥感工具，以及生态监测计划。关键指标包括\n"
"                    土地利用、栖息地状况和物种分布，这些指标依据公认的\n"
"                    框架（如世界自然保护联盟（IUCN）栖息地分类或TNFD指南）进"
"行评估。当无法获得直接\n"
"                    数据时，将使用模型估算值或外部数据库（例如GBIF、IPBES\n"
"                    区域数据）。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Data are obtained through direct flow measurements, smart meters, or\n"
"                supplier-provided utility records. In areas where direct "
"monitoring is not\n"
"                available, estimates are based on production volumes, water "
"intensity factors, or\n"
"                modeled consumption data."
msgstr ""
"数据通过直接流量测量、智能水表或\n"
"                供应商提供的公用事业记录获取。在无法进行直接监测的\n"
"                地区，估算值基于生产量、用水强度系数或\n"
"                模型模拟的用水量数据。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Data are reviewed by the environmental management team and verified by "
"accredited\n"
"                third parties under ISO 14001 or equivalent standards."
msgstr ""
"数据由环境管理团队审核，并由经认证的\n"
"                第三方机构根据 ISO 14001 或同等标准进行验证。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Data are reviewed internally by sustainability and environmental experts.\n"
"                    Where relevant, external assurance is performed under "
"recognized standards\n"
"                    (e.g., ISO 14001 Environmental Management Systems, IUCN "
"methodologies)."
msgstr ""
"数据由内部的可持续发展和环境专家进行审核。\n"
"                    在相关情况下，将根据公认标准进行外部核查\n"
"                    （例如，ISO 14001 环境管理体系、IUCN 方法论）。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_social_b
msgid ""
"Data are reviewed internally by sustainability, social-impact, or CSR\n"
"                        specialists. Third-party assurance is performed for "
"high-risk projects or\n"
"                        regions, following recognized standards (e.g., "
"AA1000 Assurance Standard,\n"
"                        ISO 26000 guidelines)."
msgstr ""
"数据由可持续发展、社会影响或企业社会责任（CSR）\n"
"                        领域的专家进行内部审核。对于高风险项目或\n"
"                        地区，将按照公认标准（例如 AA1000 保证标准、\n"
"                        ISO 26000 指南）进行第三方保证。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Data are verified internally by the environmental management team and, "
"where\n"
"                applicable, externally assured under ISO 14046 (Water "
"Footprint) or ISO 14001."
msgstr ""
"数据由环境管理团队进行内部核查，并在\n"
"                适用情况下，根据 ISO 14046（水足迹）或 ISO 14001 标准进行外部"
"核证。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c5
msgid "Data can come from HR, payroll, or contractor management systems."
msgstr "数据可来自人力资源、工资单或承包商管理系统。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b8
msgid "Data collected from Employee App and HR system."
msgstr "数据来自员工应用和人力资源系统。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid "Data integration includes:"
msgstr "数据整合包括："

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_basic_for_prepation
msgid "Data maturity or availability"
msgstr "数据成熟度或可用性"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e1
msgid "Data should align with GHG inventory (E1-6)."
msgstr "数据应与温室气体库存（E1-6）保持一致。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b8
msgid "Data tracked through Employee App and verified against HR records."
msgstr "数据通过员工应用程序进行追踪，并根据人力资源记录进行核对。"

