msgid ""
"Dedicated recycling stations are in place to facilitate waste sorting. These "
"may cover streams such as:"
msgstr "已设置专用回收站以方便垃圾分类。这些回收站可能涵盖以下类别："

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:esg.action_esg_gasses_list
msgid ""
"Define gases to convert emissions into CO₂ equivalents using Global Warming "
"Potential values."
msgstr "设定不同气体，以使用“全球变暖潜势”数值，将排放量换算为二氧化碳当量。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:esg.action_view_emission_factor
msgid "Define how activity data translates into CO₂e."
msgstr "设定活动数据如何换算为二氧化碳当量。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_iro_management
msgid ""
"Define the business context, operations, value chain, geographies, and high-"
"risk activities."
msgstr "界定业务背景、运营、价值链、地理区域及高风险活动。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
msgid "Deforestation Policy"
msgstr "毁林防控政策"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:esg.esg_report_kanban_view
