msgstr "删除"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_basic_for_prepation
msgid ""
"Describe\n"
"                                the basis for preparing your sustainability "
"statement (reporting\n"
"                                period,\n"
"                                entities included, standards applied)."
msgstr "说明可持续发展声明的编制依据（报告期间、纳入主体、适用标准）。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_governance
msgid ""
"Describe\n"
"                                whether and how sustainability performance "
"affects remuneration and\n"
"                                incentive\n"
"                                schemes."
msgstr "说明可持续发展绩效是否、以及如何影响薪酬与激励机制。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Describe <strong>how the company engages its workforce</strong>\n"
"                                regarding these topics. Examples:"
msgstr ""
"阐述<strong>公司围绕相关议题开展员工沟通与互动的方式</strong>，示例包括："

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s3
msgid ""
"Describe accessibility measures\n"
"                                                                (languages, "
"anonymity). Clarify how\n"
"                                                                lessons "
"learned feed back into\n"
"                                                                community "
"engagement or impact\n"
"                                                                mitigation."
msgstr ""
"说明反馈渠道的无障碍保障措施（多语言支持、匿名机制），并阐明如何将经验复盘成"
"果应用于社区沟通与影响缓释工作。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s4
msgid ""
"Describe accessibility measures\n"
"                                                            (languages, "
"devices,\n"
"                                                            anonymity). "
"Clarify how insights are\n"
"                                                            used to improve\n"
"                                                            products/"
"services."
msgstr ""
"说明渠道无障碍保障措施（多语言、多设备、匿名机制），并阐明如何运用收集的洞察"
"优化产品与服务。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_strategy
msgid ""
"Describe all the key resources your company relies on to deliver its\n"
"                                business\n"
"                                model (financial, industrial, intellectual, "
"human/social, and\n"
"                                natural\n"
"                                capital) and explain how each contributes to "
"creating sustainable\n"
"                                value.\n"
"                                Focus on what is material for your strategy "
"and ESG ambitions."
msgstr ""
"说明企业商业模式所依赖的全部核心资源（财务、产业、知识产权、人力社会资本及自"
"然资本），并分别说明各类资源如何助力可持续价值创造，重点披露对企业战略与ESG目"
"标具有实质性影响的内容。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c4
msgid ""
"Describe exposure, sensitivity, and mitigation measures in clear, concise "
"terms."
msgstr "清晰、简洁地阐述风险暴露程度、风险敏感度及风险缓释措施。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s2
msgid ""
"Describe how accessibility is ensured\n"
"                                                    (languages,\n"
"                                                    anonymity). Clarify how "
"learnings feed back\n"
"                                                    into\n"
"                                                    due-diligence or "
"training."
msgstr ""
"说明无障碍保障方式（多语言、匿名机制），并阐明如何将复盘成果应用于尽职调查与"
"员工培训工作。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_g1
msgid ""
"Describe how supplier relationships\n"
"                                                                are\n"
"                                                                monitored "
"and managed to uphold\n"
"                                                                governance\n"
"                                                                standards."
msgstr "阐述企业如何监控与管理供应商合作关系，持续维护治理合规标准。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
msgid ""
"Describe key actions taken or planned, the resources\n"
"                                            allocated, their\n"
"                                            mitigation hierarchy layer "
"(avoid, reduce, restore,\n"
"                                            offset), stakeholder\n"
"                                            involvement, and incorporation "
"of local/indigenous\n"
"                                            knowledge or\n"
"                                            nature-based solutions."
msgstr ""
"阐述已实施或规划的关键举措、配套投入资源、对应的风险缓释层级（规避、降低、修"
"复、抵消）、利益相关方参与方式，以及对本地/原住民知识、基于自然的解决方案的融"
"入应用情况。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e5
msgid ""
"Describe main initiatives (e.g., design for reuse,\n"
"                                            recycling\n"
"                                            programs, supply chain "
"collaboration) and indicate\n"
"                                            budget, human, or\n"
"                                            technological resources "
"dedicated to implementation."
msgstr ""
"阐述主要专项举措（如可复用设计、回收体系、供应链协同项目等），并说明投入的预"
"算、人力及技术资源。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e2
msgid "Describe reduction/substitution strategies and progress."
msgstr "描述简化/替换策略及进展情况。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_governance
msgid "Describe sectors, products, geographies"
msgstr "说明所属行业、产品品类及经营地域范围。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c3
msgid ""
"Describe strategic climate actions that go beyond operational energy/GHG "
"initiatives."
msgstr "描述超越运营层面能源/温室气体举措的战略性气候行动。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_iro_management
msgid ""
"Describe the actions you take and resources used for each material\n"
"                                sustainability matter."
msgstr ""
"请描述针对每个材料\n"
"                                可持续性问题所采取的行动及使用的资源。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Describe the extent of collective bargaining coverage and\n"
"                                        the processes in\n"
"                                        place for social dialogue, ensuring "
"they are effective and\n"
"                                        cover all\n"
"                                        material aspects."
msgstr ""
"描述集体谈判的覆盖范围以及\n"
"                                        现行的\n"
"                                        社会对话流程，确保其有效并\n"
"                                        涵盖所有\n"
"                                        实质性方面。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_strategy
msgid ""
"Describe the interaction between your material impacts, risks,\n"
"                                opportunities\n"
"                                and your business model. Explain how "
"material sustainability topics\n"
"                                influence your strategic choices."
msgstr ""
"描述您的重大影响、风险、\n"
"                                机遇\n"
"                                与您的商业模式之间的相互作用。说明重大可持续"
"发展议题\n"
"                                如何影响您的战略选择。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_strategy
msgid ""
"Describe the main strategic objective of the company, e.g.,\n"
"                                serving\n"
"                                specific markets, customer segments, or "
"sustainability goals."
msgstr ""
"描述公司主要战略目标，例如：\n"
"                                服务\n"
"                                特定市场、客户群体或可持续发展目标。"

#. module: esg
