"                            ]</strong>。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b6
msgid "If consumption is “not applicable,” state it clearly."
msgstr "如果“不适用”，请明确说明。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b4
msgid ""
"If data is estimated, add a brief methodology note (no detailed calculations "
"needed)."
msgstr "若数据为估算值，请添加简短的方法说明（无需详细计算过程）。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b4
msgid ""
"If emissions are already reported under environmental permits, you may "
"simply refer to the source."
msgstr "如果排放数据已在环境许可中报告，您可以直接引用源文本。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c6
msgid ""
"If no due-diligence process exists, state this fact and optionally add "
"future plans."
msgstr "若不存在尽职调查流程，请说明此情况，并可酌情补充未来计划。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b5
msgid "If no sites are in sensitive areas, explicitly state “none.”"
msgstr "若无涉及敏感领域的站点，请明确注明“无”。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b7
msgid "If relevant, report waste diverted from disposal (recycling, reuse)."
msgstr "若相关，请报告从处置中分流的废弃物（回收利用、再利用）。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b7
msgid ""
"If some data is estimated, provide a brief explanation of the estimation "
"method or assumptions."
msgstr "若部分数据为估算值，请简要说明估算方法或相关假设。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c7
msgid ""
"If the company has grievance or ethics channels, they may be referenced but "
"not required."
msgstr "如果公司设有申诉或道德渠道，可予以提及，但不作强制要求。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b9
msgid ""
"If the total hours worked are not directly available, companies may estimate "
"2,000 hours per full-time worker per year."
msgstr ""
"如果无法直接获取总工作时长，企业可按每位全职员工每年 2,000 小时进行估算。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e1
msgid ""
"If the your company has no validated SBTi targets, explain\n"
"                                        alignment\n"
"                                        efforts."
msgstr ""
"如果贵公司没有经过验证的 SBTi 目标，请说明\n"
"                                        为保持一致\n"
"                                        所做的努力。"

#. module: esg
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:esg.field_esg_metric__financial_impacts_value
msgid "If these impacts occur, how large could the financial effects be?"
msgstr "如果这些影响发生，其财务影响可能有多大？"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c2
msgid ""
"If you answered YES to existing practices/policies/future initiatives in "
"disclosure B2, please briefly describe them along with their consequent "
"actions. (Include supplier/client coverage if relevant)"
msgstr ""
"如果您在披露项 B2 中对现有实践/政策/未来举措回答“是”，请简要描述这些内容及其"
"后续行动。（如相关，请说明供应商/客户的覆盖范围）"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c2
msgid ""
"If you answered YES to future initiatives/targets in disclosure B2, please "
"specify them."
msgstr "如果您在披露项 B2 中对未来举措/目标回答“是”，请具体说明。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e2
msgid ""
"If your company has no validated SBTi targets, explain\n"
"                                        alignment efforts."
msgstr ""
"如果贵公司没有经过验证的 SBTi 目标，请说明\n"
"                                        为保持一致所做的努力。"

#. module: esg
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:esg.field_esg_database__image
msgid "Image"
msgstr "图片"

