msgid "Impact Metrics Related to Biodiversity and Ecosystems Change (E4-5)"
msgstr "生物多样性与生态系统变化相关影响指标（E4-5）"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
msgid ""
"Impact Metrics Related to Biodiversity and Ecosystems Change (E4-5) <span "
"class=\"d-print-none\">[Material]</span>"
msgstr ""
"生物多样性与生态系统变化相关影响指标（E4-5） <span class=\"d-print-none\">[重"
"大实质性议题]</span>"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
msgid ""
"Impact Metrics Related to Biodiversity and Ecosystems Change (E4-5) <span "
"class=\"d-print-none\">[Non Material]</span>"
msgstr ""
"生物多样性与生态系统变化相关影响指标（E4-5） <span class=\"d-print-none\">[非"
"重大实质性议题]</span>"

#. module: esg
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:esg.field_esg_metric__impact_severity_score
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:esg.esg_metric_impact_severity_score_form_view
msgid "Impact Severity"
msgstr "影响严重程度"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c1
msgid ""
"Impact materiality is determined by scoring the scale, scope, and "
"remediability of impacts (1-5), with an average score ≥ 3 considered "
"material."
msgstr ""
"影响重要性通过为影响的规模、范围和可补救性评分（1-5）确定，平均分 ≥ 3 即视为"
"重大。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c1
msgid ""
"Impact materiality, evaluating the undertaking's actual and potential "
"effects on the environment, society, and human rights;"
msgstr "影响重要性，评估企业对环境、社会和人权的实际及潜在影响；"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:esg.esg_metric_form_view
msgid "Impact, Risk, and Opportunity (IRO) Assessment"
msgstr "影响、风险与机遇（IRO）评估"

#. module: esg
#: model:knowledge.article,template_name:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_iro_management
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_iro_management
msgid "Impact, risk and opportunity management"
msgstr "影响、风险和机遇管理"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b11
msgid ""
"Implement a supplier code of conduct, track compliance, and communicate "
"expectations clearly. Include procedures for remedial actions if violations "
"occur."
msgstr ""
"推行供应商行为准则，跟踪合规情况，并清晰传达相关期望。若发生违规行为，应设置"
"相应的补救措施程序。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_governance
msgid ""
"Implementation and effectiveness of due diligence and related\n"
"                                policies"
msgstr ""
"尽职调查及相关\n"
"                                政策的实施情况与有效性"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s3
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s4
msgid ""
"In accordance with <strong>ESRS 1 paragraphs 66-67</strong>, no\n"
"                                    detailed disclosure is provided for this "
"topic."
msgstr ""
"根据<strong>ESRS 1 第 66-67 段</strong>，本议题\n"
"                                    不提供详细披露。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e1
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e2
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e3
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e5
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_g1
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s2
msgid ""
"In accordance with <strong>ESRS 1 paragraphs 66-67</strong>, no\n"
"                                detailed disclosure is provided for this "
"topic."
msgstr ""
"根据<strong>ESRS 1 第 66-67 段</strong>，本议题\n"
"                                不提供详细披露。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid "Incidents, Complaints, and Severe Human Rights Impacts (S1-17)"
msgstr "事件、投诉及严重人权影响（S1-17）"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Incidents, Complaints, and Severe Human Rights Impacts (S1-17) <span "
"class=\"d-print-none\">[Material]</span>"
msgstr ""
"事件、投诉及严重人权影响（S1-17） <span class=\"d-print-none\">[重大实质性议"
"题]</span>"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Incidents, Complaints, and Severe Human Rights Impacts (S1-17) <span "
"class=\"d-print-none\">[Non Material]</span>"
msgstr ""
"事件、投诉及严重人权影响（S1-17） <span class=\"d-print-none\">[非重大实质性"
"议题]</span>"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_basic_for_prepation
msgid ""
"Include\n"
"                                all entities within the group structure. "
"Indicate if some are\n"
"                                excluded due\n"
"                                to non-materiality or exemption and provide "
"the rationale in\n"
"                                “Notes.”"
msgstr ""
"纳入\n"
"                                集团架构内的所有主体。如部分主体因\n"
"                                非重大性或\n"
"                                豁免而被排除，请说明原因，并在\n"
"                                “备注”中提供理由。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Include <strong>key categories only</strong>:\n"
"                                                                    employment "
"type, gender, function, and\n"
"                                                                    geography"
msgstr ""
"仅包含<strong>关键类别</strong>：\n"
"                                                                    雇佣类型"
"、性别、职能和\n"
"                                                                    地理区域"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Include <strong>verification status</strong> (internal/external,\n"
"                            partial/full)."
msgstr ""
"纳入<strong>验证状态</strong>（内部/外部、\n"
"                            部分/完整）。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c3
msgid ""
"Include Scope 3 only for material categories and with sufficient data "
"quality."
msgstr "仅对具有重大性的类别纳入范围三，且数据质量需足够。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e3
msgid ""
"Include actions targeting high-risk basins and specify the\n"
"                                        layer of the <strong>mitigation\n"
"                                            hierarchy</strong> (avoid/reduce/"
"restore)."
msgstr ""
"请列出针对高风险流域的行动，并说明该行动属于\n"
"                                        <strong>缓解\n"
"                                            层级</strong>的哪一层次（避免/减"
"少/恢复）。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b10
msgid ""
"Include additional guaranteed fixed payments that are part of the entry-"
"level wage."
msgstr "应计入入职起薪中固定发放的额外保障性报酬。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b11
msgid ""
"Include all fines, even if settled out of court, if imposed under applicable "
"anti-corruption laws. Clearly document calculation and reporting sources."
msgstr ""
"若依据适用的反腐败法律被处以罚款，即使已庭外和解，也应全部计入。应清晰记录计"
"算依据与披露来源。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c9
msgid "Include all members, even if gender is “other” or “not declared.”"
msgstr "应包含全部成员，即使其性别为“其他”或“未填报”。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c8
msgid ""
"Include all revenue sources even if below thresholds. Zero values should be "
"explicitly reported."
msgstr "应纳入所有收入来源，即使低于阈值。零值也应明确报告。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b9
msgid ""
"Include both ongoing and planned initiatives. Use concrete examples to "
"illustrate the type of actions, their coverage, and expected outcomes."
msgstr ""
"既要包含正在实施的举措，也要包含计划中的举措。请用具体示例说明行动的类型、覆"
"盖范围以及预期成果。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c4
msgid "Include both short-term (acute) and long-term (chronic) risks."
msgstr "同时涵盖短期（急性）与长期（慢性）风险。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c5
msgid "Include contractors working only for the company."
msgstr "包括仅为本公司工作的承包商。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_g1
msgid ""
"Include financial and non-financial activities with\n"
"                                            context."
msgstr ""
"纳入财务与非财务活动，并说明\n"
"                                            相关背景。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Include frequency rates, coverage, and severity\n"
"                                            indicators. Explain\n"
"                                            preventive actions or "
"certifications (e.g., ISO 45001)."
msgstr ""
"包含频率、覆盖范围及严重程度\n"
"                                            指标。说明\n"
"                                            预防措施或认证情况（例如：ISO "
"45001）。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b1
msgid ""
"Include legal form, sector code, financial scale, workforce, and geolocation "
"of major sites."
msgstr "列明法律形式、行业代码、财务规模、员工队伍以及主要场所的地理位置。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s4
msgid ""
"Include measurable, time-bound targets aligned with your\n"
"                                            supplier\n"
"                                            policies. State which indicators "
"show improvement over\n"
"                                            time."
msgstr ""
"包含与供应商政策\n"
"                                            相一致的\n"
"                                            可衡量、有时限的目标。说明哪些指"
"标随时间推移\n"
"                                            有所改善。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s2
msgid ""
"Include measurable, time-bound targets aligned with your\n"
"                                        supplier policies.\n"
"                                        State which indicators show "
"improvement over time."
msgstr ""
"纳入与贵司供应商政策相一致、可衡量且有时限的\n"
"                                        目标。\n"
"                                        说明哪些指标体现随时间的改善情况。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s3
msgid ""
"Include measurable, time-bound targets. State which\n"
"                                                indicators show\n"
"                                                improvements over time."
msgstr ""
"包含可衡量、有时限的目标。说明哪些\n"
"                                                指标体现出\n"
"                                                随时间推移的改善。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b9
msgid ""
"Include mental health cases only if voluntarily disclosed and confirmed by a "
"licensed healthcare professional."
msgstr "仅当自愿披露并经执业医疗专业人员确认时，才纳入心理健康案例。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Include only <strong>material workforce\n"
"                                                        characteristics</"
"strong> relevant to\n"
"                                                        impacts, risks, and "
"opportunities."
msgstr ""
"仅包含与\n"
"                                                        影响、风险和机遇相关"
"的<strong>重大员工队伍\n"
"                                                        特征</strong>。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c5
msgid "Include only employees formally classified at management level."
msgstr "仅包括正式归入管理层级的员工。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c2
msgid ""
"Include only relevant practices, policies, and initiatives (no need for long "
"lists)."
msgstr "仅包含相关的实践、政策和举措（无需列出冗长清单）。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c5
msgid "Include workers supplied by agencies."
msgstr "包括由劳务公司提供的员工。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c5
msgid ""
"Include workers with material impact or significant numbers relative to the "
"workforce."
msgstr "应包含对劳动力有实质性影响或人数占比较大的员工。"

#. module: esg
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/esg/static/src/no_content_helper/no_content_helper.xml:0
msgid "Included in Accounting"
msgstr "包括在会计中"

#. module: esg
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/esg/static/src/no_content_helper/no_content_helper.xml:0
msgid "Included in Invoicing"
msgstr "包括在发票中"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Includes 3-5 years of pollution data for key indicators with year-on-year "
"trends and\n"
"                explanations for major variations."
msgstr ""
"包含关键指标的 3-5 年污染数据，附带同比趋势及\n"
"                主要波动的解释。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Includes 3-5 years of water consumption, discharge, and recycling trends, "
"showing\n"
"                efficiency gains or impacts from climate variability and "
"operational changes."
msgstr ""
"包含 3-5 年的用水量、排放量和循环利用趋势，展示\n"
"                能效提升情况，或气候变化及运营调整带来的影响。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_basic_for_prepation
msgid ""
"Includes <strong>downstream</strong> (customers, end users)\n"
"                                activities."
msgstr ""
"包括<strong>下游</strong> （客户、最终用户）\n"
"                                活动。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_basic_for_prepation
msgid "Includes <strong>upstream</strong> (suppliers, contractors),"
msgstr "包括上游的<strong>（供应商、承包商），</strong> ，"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c9
msgid "Includes legally recognized third genders if applicable"
msgstr "如适用，应包含法律认可的第三性别"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b8
msgid "Includes permanent, temporary, and other contract types."
msgstr "包括永久性、临时性及其他合同类型。"

#. module: esg
