#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s2
msgid ""
"Policies align with the ILO Fundamental Conventions, UN Guiding\n"
"                                Principles on Business and Human Rights, and "
"the OECD Due-Diligence\n"
"                                Guidance for Responsible Business Conduct."
msgstr ""
"相关政策符合国际劳工组织基本公约、《联合国\n"
"                                工商业与人权指导原则》以及 OECD 负责任商业行"
"为\n"
"                                尽职调查指南。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
msgid ""
"Policies cover\n"
"                                    biodiversity-sensitive areas, protected "
"sites, ecosystem\n"
"                                    services, and value-chain traceability. "
"They align with<strong>\n"
"                                        <em> Post-2020 Biodiversity "
"Framework and EU 2030 Strategy.</em>\n"
"                                    </strong>"
msgstr ""
"政策涵盖\n"
"                                    生物多样性敏感区域、受保护地、生态系统\n"
"                                    服务和价值链可追溯性。这些政策与<strong>"
"\n"
"                                        <em> 《2020 年后全球生物多样性框架》"
"和欧盟 2030 年战略。</em>\n"
"                                    </strong>保持一致。"

