#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c1
msgid ""
"Products and services are provided through <strong>[describe distribution "
"channels (e.g., B2B, wholesale, retail)]</strong>,\n"
"                        supported by business relationships with "
"<strong>[specify key suppliers, partners, and customers]</strong>\n"
"                        that contribute to operational continuity and "
"responsible value-chain practices."
msgstr ""
"产品和服务通过<strong>[描述分销渠道（例如：B2B、批发、零售）]</strong>提供"
"，\n"
"                        并依托与<strong>[列明主要供应商、合作伙伴和客户]</"
"strong>的业务关系，\n"
"                        这些关系有助于保障运营连续性并践行负责任的价值链实践"
"。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_strategy
