msgstr "利润（经济与财务）"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_g1
msgid ""
"Programs include training, internal audits, reporting\n"
"                                        channels, and\n"
"                                        third-party assessments to detect "
"and prevent corrupt\n"
"                                        practices."
msgstr ""
"计划包括培训、内部审计、举报\n"
"                                        渠道，以及\n"
"                                        第三方评估，用于发现并预防腐败\n"
"                                        行为。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Programs or initiatives (e.g., wellness programs, training\n"
"                                        plans)"
msgstr ""
"计划或举措（例如：员工福祉计划、培训\n"
"                                        计划）"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_governance
msgid "Progress against KPIs and targets"
msgstr "KPI 与目标的进展情况"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
msgid "Protected area management"
msgstr "保护区管理"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b7
msgid ""
"Provide a clear explanation of how circular economy principles are applied; "
"descriptions can remain high-level."
msgstr "请清晰说明循环经济原则的应用方式；描述可保持概括性。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_strategy
msgid "Provide a concise description of your value chain."
msgstr "简要描述您的价值链。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c9
msgid "Provide both current and previous year figures to show progress."
msgstr "同时提供本年度与上一年度数据，以展示进展。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_g1
msgid ""
"Provide both quantitative and qualitative\n"
"                                                information."
msgstr ""
"同时提供定量与定性\n"
"                                                信息。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e3
msgid ""
"Provide context such as <strong>basin conditions</strong>, <strong>water-"
"stress\n"
"                                        mapping</strong>, and major "
"efficiency drivers."
msgstr ""
"请提供背景信息，如<strong>流域状况</strong>、<strong>水资源压力\n"
"                                        分布图</strong>以及主要效率驱动因素。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Provide disaggregated data on training and skills\n"
"                                        development, focusing on\n"
"                                        material aspects such as hours of "
"training and participation\n"
"                                        rates."
msgstr ""
"提供培训和技能\n"
"                                        发展方面的分类数据，重点关注\n"
"                                        培训时长和参与率等\n"
"                                        实质性方面。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Provide diversity metrics, ensuring that the data is\n"
"                                        disaggregated and\n"
"                                        covers all material aspects."
msgstr ""
"提供多样性指标，确保数据经过\n"
"                                        分类统计，并\n"
"                                        涵盖所有实质性方面。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_iro_management
msgid ""
"Provide information on criteria and thresholds used in\n"
"                                            materiality\n"
"                                            determination."
msgstr ""
"提供关于重要性\n"
"                                            判定所使用标准和阈值的\n"
"                                            信息。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Provide information on the characteristics of\n"
"                                                            non-employees."
msgstr ""
"提供关于\n"
"                                                            非雇员特征的信息"
"。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Provide information on the characteristics of\n"
"                                                employees."
msgstr ""
"提供关于\n"
"                                                员工特征的信息。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Provide information on the inclusion of persons with\n"
"                                        disabilities, ensuring\n"
"                                        that the data is disaggregated and "
"covers all material\n"
"                                        aspects. Provide\n"
"                                        quantitative data and describe "
"inclusion measures or\n"
"                                        reasonable\n"
"                                        accommodation policies."
msgstr ""
"提供关于残疾人士\n"
"                                        包容情况的信息，确保\n"
"                                        数据经过分类统计并涵盖所有实质性\n"
"                                        方面。提供\n"
"                                        量化数据，并说明包容措施或\n"
"                                        合理\n"
"                                        便利政策。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
msgid ""
"Provide metrics measuring performance against material\n"
"                                        impacts on\n"
"                                        ecosystems and species, including "
"ecosystem extent,\n"
"                                        condition, species\n"
"                                        population trends, land-use changes, "
"and presence in\n"
"                                        biodiversity-sensitive\n"
"                                        areas."
msgstr ""
"提供各项指标，衡量在应对\n"
"                                        生态系统和物种重大\n"
"                                        影响方面的绩效，包括生态系统范围、\n"
"                                        状况、物种\n"
"                                        种群趋势、土地利用变化，以及在\n"
"                                        生物多样性敏感\n"
"                                        区域内的分布情况。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Provide transparency on how data related to material use, waste, and "
"circular\n"
"                    economy performance are measured, consolidated, and "
"verified across the\n"
"                    undertaking."
msgstr ""
"就材料使用、废弃物和循环经济\n"
"                    绩效相关数据如何在整个企业范围内\n"
"                    进行计量、汇总和验证提供透明度说明。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_governance_c
msgid ""
"Provide transparency on how governance, corporate culture, and ethics data "
"are\n"
"                measured, consolidated, and verified."
msgstr ""
"就治理、企业文化和道德相关数据如何\n"
"                计量、汇总和验证提供透明度说明。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Provide transparency on how pollution-related data are measured, "
"consolidated, and\n"
"                verified."
msgstr ""
"就污染相关数据如何计量、汇总和\n"
"                验证提供透明度说明。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_environmental_a
msgid ""
"Provide transparency on how water- and marine-related data are measured,\n"
"                consolidated, and verified across the undertaking."
msgstr ""
"就水资源与海洋相关数据如何在整个企业范围内计量、\n"
"                汇总和验证提供透明度说明。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_social_b
msgid ""
"Provide transparency on how workforce data are measured, consolidated, and\n"
"                        verified."
msgstr ""
"就员工队伍数据如何计量、汇总和\n"
"                        验证提供透明度说明。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_social_b
msgid ""
"Provide transparency on how workforce data are measured, consolidated, and "
"verified."
msgstr "就员工队伍数据如何计量、汇总和验证提供透明度说明。"

