#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
msgid ""
"Quantify or qualitatively describe potential financial\n"
"                                            effects of\n"
"                                            biodiversity-related risks and "
"opportunities on cash\n"
"                                            flows, performance,\n"
"                                            and position over short-, "
"medium-, and long-term\n"
"                                            horizons, including key\n"
"                                            assumptions and uncertainties."
msgstr ""
"量化或定性描述潜在的财务\n"
"                                            影响，即\n"
"                                            生物多样性相关风险和机遇在短期、"
"中期和长期\n"
"                                            对现金流、经营业绩\n"
"                                            和财务状况产生的影响，\n"
"                                            并说明关键\n"
"                                            假设和不确定性。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e2
msgid ""
"Quantify potential financial impact (fines, remediation,\n"
"                                            shutdowns)\n"
"                                            where possible."
msgstr ""
"在可能的情况下量化潜在的财务影响\n"
"                                            （罚款、整改、\n"
"                                            停产）。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e5
msgid ""
"Quantify total material inflows (tonnes/kg) and\n"
"                                            indicate the share\n"
"                                            from recycled, reused, or "
"renewable sources. Specify\n"
"                                            data collection\n"
"                                            methods (direct measurement vs. "
"estimation) and\n"
"                                            include\n"
"                                            certification schemes for "
"sustainable sourcing."
msgstr ""
"量化材料总流入量（吨/千克），并\n"
"                                            说明其中来自\n"
"                                            再生、再利用或可再生来源的占比。"
"说明\n"
"                                            数据收集\n"
"                                            方法（直接计量还是估算），并\n"
"                                            纳入\n"
"                                            可持续采购的认证体系。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_metrics_targets
msgid ""
"Quantitative data are derived from recognised frameworks, regulatory\n"
"                        requirements, or\n"
"                        internal methodologies aligned with ESRS and sector-"
"specific standards."
msgstr ""
"定量数据取自公认框架、监管\n"
"                        要求，或\n"
"                        符合 ESRS 与行业特定标准的内部方法论。"

