"                                    满意度。进展通过关键绩效\n"
"                                    指标进行跟踪，例如\n"
"                                    投诉解决率、产品召回或满意度评分。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s2
msgid ""
"Targets aim to enhance social compliance, responsible sourcing, and\n"
"                                supplier-capacity building. "
"<strong>{{ company_name }}</strong> monitors\n"
"                                progress through key performance indicators "
"(audit scores, training\n"
"                                completion, remediation closure)."
msgstr ""
"目标旨在提升社会合规水平、负责任采购和\n"
"                                供应商能力建设。<strong>{{ company_name }}</"
"strong> 通过\n"
"                                关键绩效指标（审核评分、培训\n"
"                                完成情况、整改关闭情况）监测进展。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s3
msgid ""
"Targets aim to minimize negative impacts, advance positive\n"
"                                    outcomes, and\n"
"                                    enhance\n"
"                                    community wellbeing. Progress is "
"monitored via KPIs such as\n"
"                                    grievance\n"
"                                    resolution\n"
"                                    rates, participation in engagement "
"programs, and local-benefit\n"
"                                    metrics."
msgstr ""
"目标旨在尽可能减少负面影响、促进正面\n"
"                                    成果，并\n"
"                                    提升\n"
"                                    社区福祉。进展通过 KPI 监测，例如\n"
"                                    申诉\n"
"                                    解决\n"
"                                    率、参与互动计划的情况，以及当地受益\n"
"                                    指标。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Targets aim to reduce negative impacts and advance positive outcomes\n"
"                                for the\n"
"                                workforce. They should be specific, "
"measurable, time-bound, and\n"
"                                linked to policies\n"
"                                or action plans. Coverage should include "
"employees and, where\n"
"                                material, non-employee\n"
"                                workers. Targets may focus on diversity, "
"skills development,\n"
"                                occupational health\n"
"                                &amp; safety, and grievance resolution."
msgstr ""
"目标旨在减少负面影响并带来正面成果\n"
"                                惠及整个\n"
"                                员工队伍。目标应当具体、可衡量、有时限，并\n"
"                                与政策\n"
"                                或行动计划相衔接。覆盖范围应包括员工，并在具"
"有重大性时\n"
"                                纳入非雇员\n"
"                                工作者。目标可以聚焦于多样性、技能发展、\n"
"                                职业健康\n"
"                                与安全以及申诉处理。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e5
msgid ""
"Targets aim to reduce virgin material use, improve recycling and\n"
"                                reuse rates, and increase product "
"circularity. They align with <em>\n"
"                                    <strong>EU Circular Economy objectives "
"and waste-hierarchy\n"
"                                principles.</strong>\n"
"                                </em>"
msgstr ""
"相关目标旨在减少原生材料使用，提高回收和\n"
"                                再利用率，并提升产品循环性。这些目标与 <em>\n"
"                                    <strong>欧盟循环经济目标及废弃物层级\n"
"                                原则</strong>\n"
"                                </em>保持一致。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
msgid ""
"Targets align with biodiversity policies and international\n"
"                                frameworks. They use\n"
"                                scientific thresholds, ecological "
"allocations, and clearly define\n"
"                                scope and\n"
"                                measurement methods."
msgstr ""
"各项目标与生物多样性政策和国际\n"
"                                框架保持一致。目标采用\n"
"                                科学阈值和生态分配量，并清晰界定\n"
"                                范围\n"
"                                和计量方法。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e1
msgid ""
"Targets are aligned with Science-Based Targets initiative (SBTi)\n"
"                                methodology\n"
"                                and\n"
"                                reviewed every two years."
msgstr ""
"目标与科学碳目标倡议（SBTi）\n"
"                                方法论保持一致，\n"
"                                并\n"
"                                每两年审查一次。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e2
msgid ""
"Targets are aligned with Science-Based Targets initiative (SBTi)\n"
"                                methodology and\n"
"                                reviewed every two years."
msgstr ""
"目标与科学碳目标倡议（SBTi）\n"
"                                方法论保持一致，\n"
"                                并每两年审查一次。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e3
msgid ""
"Targets are aligned with the company's sustainability roadmap and the<em> </"
"em><strong>\n"
"                                    <em>EU Water Framework Directive</em>\n"
"                                </strong>.\n"
"                                They aim to enhance water efficiency, "
"maintain quality, and support\n"
"                                ecosystem resilience."
msgstr ""
"这些目标与公司的可持续发展路线图以及<em> </em><strong>\n"
"                                    <em>欧盟水框架指令</em>\n"
"                                </strong>保持一致。\n"
"                                目标旨在提高用水效率、保持水质，并支持\n"
"                                生态系统韧性。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_metrics_targets
msgid "Targets for tracking effectiveness of policies and actions [MDR-T]"
msgstr "用于跟踪政策与行动有效性的目标（MDR-T）"

